<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wisconsin Energy cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wisconsin Energy cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has cut its rating for Wisconsin Energy Corp to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 26-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
